# The IPsec pre-shared key every L2TP/IPsec client must present alongside
# their per-user username/password (see chap-secrets). One PSK for the whole
# server - the admin reads it from the L2TP settings page and hands it out.
# `: PSK` with a blank left side (%any) matches any peer, which is what we
# want since clients connect from dynamic, NAT'd addresses.
: PSK "{{ hconfigs['l2tp_psk'] }}"
